SIMULATE TOOLPATH  "Rough_Dia40"
SIMULATE VIEWMILL START
SIMULATE VIEWMILL SHADING MATT
SIMULATE VIEWMILL SHADING TRIANGLES
PRINT 'Viewmill Benchmark 1'
CLOCK RESET QUIT
CLOCK ON QUIT
SIMULATE PLAY
SIMULATE VIEWMILL STOP YES
CLOCK OFF QUIT
CLOCK PRINT QUIT
PRINT '--------------------'
